{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42768858\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究血尿酸肌酐比与PD空间步态参数的关系，未涉及FOG或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42770427\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述晚期PD临床试验及轴性运动症状，但未讨论STN神经活动与FOG的关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42778232\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究SMA和颞顶联合区TMS对PD步态的影响，可提供皮层网络参与步态障碍的间接机制证据，但未直接研究FOG或STN。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42781387\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者虚拟现实行走时的压力中心动力学特征，未涉及FOG或STN神经信号。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42781434\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述涵盖DBS引导的神经反馈及PD神经活动调节，可能涉及STN神经信号及其运动学意义，但摘要未明确涉及FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42789569\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"荟萃分析包含FOG量表结局，可提供FOG临床表型及干预反应的交叉证据，但不涉及STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42790427\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究小鼠杏仁核至背外侧纹状体投射对运动行为的调节，与PD、FOG及STN神经活动缺乏直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42793646\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者复杂步态和姿势任务中的运动学缺陷，但未涉及FOG或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42796091\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究肠道左旋多巴凝胶治疗晚期PD的长期临床效果，未提供STN神经活动与FOG的机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42817491\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD坐站转步行过程中的肌电时频特征，可为步态启动障碍的外周运动表现提供间接证据，但未直接研究FOG或STN。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42824393\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"舞蹈康复研究方案主要关注PD运动功能和神经可塑性，未涉及STN神经活动与FOG的具体关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42827797\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD及PSP患者跌倒检测和跌倒情境分类，虽然涉及注意和执行功能，但未直接研究FOG或STN。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42852984\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者有意义的数字化移动结局，可能涉及冻结步态及其客观测量指标，可辅助FOG表型和评估方法分析，但不涉及STN活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42869427\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要研究耳戴式惯性传感器对坐站和坐站转步行运动的测量效度，与STN及FOG神经机制无直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42889039\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究PD双足节律同步异常及其与FOG量表的关系，可为FOG的节律控制和运动时序机制提供交叉证据，但未记录STN活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42903465\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要综述罗替戈汀药物治疗及持续多巴胺能刺激，未涉及STN神经活动与FOG之间的具体机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42909151\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述PD等神经系统疾病双任务步态变化，可辅助理解认知负荷和步态障碍的关系，但摘要未显示直接研究FOG或STN。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42909857\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要讨论导电水凝胶生物电子材料和慢性神经调控平台，与PD冻结步态及STN神经活动的具体证据无关。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42912442\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究丘脑底核邻近的未定带（ZI）解剖连接和拓扑组织，可能辅助理解DBS靶点定位及邻近结构对神经信号解释的影响，但没有直接PD或FOG证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42920166\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究MPTP小鼠黑质多巴胺能神经元的时间干涉刺激保护作用，靶点为黑质而非STN，且未研究FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42924687\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要综述阿根廷探戈对PD步态和康复的作用，未涉及STN神经活动或FOG的神经生理机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42939052\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD合并脊柱前屈患者的姿势康复效果，与STN神经活动和冻结步态缺乏直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42939327\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究可穿戴传感器识别PD运动表型，并明确纳入FOG负担，可辅助分析FOG异质性及客观表型，但不涉及STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42944443\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要比较步态分析中的步数检测算法，虽然包含PD数据集，但未研究FOG或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42944474\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究DAT影像和可穿戴转身特征对PD运动进展的预测价值，未涉及STN活动与FOG的关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42947838\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要汇总PD运动训练对平衡和跌倒的影响，未提供STN神经活动与FOG之间的机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42964575\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD躯干前屈与步行速度、TUG及跌倒的关系，未涉及FOG或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42981295\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD步态中的全身方向性运动耦合，与FOG及STN神经信号之间没有明确联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:42988579\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"文章主要讨论运动障碍门诊中的运动训练实施，缺少与STN神经活动及FOG机制直接相关的证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:43012884\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较不同FOG认知表型的前额叶激活差异，可为皮层执行控制与视觉空间加工两种竞争性机制提供重要交叉证据，但研究靶点不是STN。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a889961e-30a2-467a-8f66-b12184d42d21", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T151014214023Z", "elapsed_seconds": 99.14, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T15:11:53.351095+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fe46bdc4b4bbf95da3005892b0a9c6661fade54ede48334d9131f981ce3b2ce2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T151014214023Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "00254fc9e64a45bb455a2ae6622226350ebcc864009a4cfef12597a863630929"}}}
